"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
3030,"Narrated to us 'Ali ibn Khashram, who said: 'Isa informed us, on the authority of Ibn Jurayj, on the authority of Ibn Shihab, who said: Sulayman ibn Sinan narrated to us, on the authority of Ibn 'Abbas, on the authority of al-Fadl, that a woman from Khath'am said:

""O Messenger of Allah! My father is an old man who is unable to ride his camel. The obligation of Hajj has become due upon him.""

The Prophet (ﷺ) said: **""Perform Hajj on his behalf.""**

**CHAPTER:**"
